      "writtenOn": "2026-11-25T18:16:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It can\u0027t read the ring. That HAL wants one IIO device per sensor with standard scan names, and the Cros-EC ring is a single buffer for every EC sensor, tagged by sensor ID. It could poll in_accel_*_raw on the sensor device, but this driver keeps the 3.18 ABI: sampling_frequency is the EC batching interval in ms, frequency is the ODR, and there\u0027s no scale. Getting it to work means moving to mainline\u0027s cros_ec_sensors attributes, which is a bigger change than this restore.",
      "parentUuid": "93a0fee9_c7b48cc5",
      "revId": "cf59e2aef656b590266a22b484bcb02d21081b5a",
